{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0598A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"整理一下情况。首先，进入<R=研究设施,LAB>需要ID卡。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=研究设施,LAB>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。那里从外面看只是普通遗迹，但里面像是最先进的研究设施。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"然后，ID卡被一个穿橙色夹克的士兵拿走了，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"没错。而且当时那里有凤尾绿咬鹃在叫。距离那时也没过去多久。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"如果那士兵在巡逻就麻烦了，不过要是固定岗哨……。那只凤尾绿咬鹃没移动吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我想巢就在附近。应该不会突然消失。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"好，赶紧找到那个士兵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"如果忘了叫声，我再给你学一次。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"想听我的叫声了，就用无线电<R=联系,CALL>我。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=联系,CALL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}